Z||000009||grinthock||08-07-2001||06:22 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Slammed Fiero:<BR><B>On the bottom mount how about a welded in triangle? to join the body mount and the strut mount?<P>JM </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>You read my mind JM, looks like that weld over time might give, not that I question your quality Rodney!!! You are amazing!  and usually bolts break before welds, but that might make the kit a LITTLE stronger.<P>The problem is JM, this moves away from Rodney's time honoured tradition of No drilling or modifications required for installation. <p>[This message has been edited by grinthock (edited 08-07-2001).]||||reg||1
