Z||000011||Rodney||08-08-2001||08:35 PM||||You read my mind JM, looks like that weld over time might give, not that I question your quality Rodney!!! You are amazing! and usually bolts break before welds, but that might make the kit a LITTLE stronger.<P>--------------------------------------------<P>I will gaurentee the brackets from breaking forever. Even if the car is bought and sold several times over. The welds will never fail. I'm quite sure of that. : )||||reg||1
